  "instructions": [
    "heat oil in the clay tajine over medium heat.",
    "add onion and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "add garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "add cumin, coriander, cayenne pepper, salt, and black pepper. cook for 1 minute.",
    "add lamb and cook until browned on all sides, about 5 minutes.",
    "add sugar, chicken broth, and apricot jam. bring to a boil.",
